{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"x":0.89690721855798605,"t":"Test 4","y":0.044920728020555689,"w":0.063917522430419926,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1},{"w":0.037113402684529631,"x":0.065979381008250654,"y":0.094476744300231674,"t":"ROB:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1},{"x":0.14014754552994399,"h":0.017146258933783631,"c":1,"t":"Yes, the first duck in each race to arrive at the finishing line wins its owner free","w":0.66812698364257805,"y":0.090502393434069961},{"t":"tickets for the concert on the last night of the festival.","h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.13814432935153556,"y":0.10745742796183577,"w":0.44742268880208336,"c":1},{"x":0.065979382545418006,"w":0.065979379018147807,"c":1,"t":"MELANIE:","h":0.010174418083723991,"y":0.12645348861438799},{"t":"You said you can buy a duck? I'm sure my children will both want one.","y":0.12354651167682618,"h":0.014534883616744709,"c":1,"x":0.1422680429440597,"w":0.59175257364908851},{"h":0.0087209299460482281,"w":0.037113402684529631,"y":0.14389534895139455,"t":"ROB:","c":1,"x":0.065979381008250654},{"h":0.019083969465648831,"c":1,"w":0.70515462239583337,"t":"They're on sale at a stall in the market. You can't miss it - it's got an enormous sign","x":0.14020619389956218,"y":0.13945977680291022},{"x":0.13814433530928349,"y":0.15697674422041374,"w":0.23298967997233072,"t":"showing a couple of ducks.","h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1278350630426317,"t":"OK. IIl go there this afternoon. I remember walking past there yesterday. Now could","w":0.71958760579427083,"y":0.17146212548759665,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"t":"you tell me something about the flower show, please?","w":0.45583440144856768,"x":0.14012373779047219,"h":0.015973543042794969,"c":1,"y":0.18746337075678043},{"x":0.13814433346357446,"w":0.58350514729817704,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"y":0.20493247217055566,"t":"Well, admission is free, and the show is being held in Bythwaite Hall."},{"h":0.0090228627866251188,"y":0.22368624301025397,"w":0.066058483123779294,"t":"MELANIE:","x":0.065939830493229407,"c":1},{"w":0.24948453267415366,"t":"Sorry, how do you spell that?","h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"y":0.22078684657865999,"x":0.13608247582960425},{"x":0.063917526467319616,"c":1,"w":0.039175256093343103,"t":"ROB:","h":0.010174418083723991,"y":0.23837209324738218},{"c":1,"x":0.13790410843672399,"h":0.017537119804377888,"t":"B-Y-T-H-W-A-I-T-E. Bythwaite.","y":0.2340612735697829,"w":0.26240023295084636},{"w":0.54226806640625003,"h":0.013211978860833917,"c":1,"x":0.06597936877082565,"t":"MELANIE: Is it easy to find? I'm not very familiar with the town yet.","y":0.25278919537808897},{"c":1,"h":0.010174418083724102,"t":"ROB:","x":0.065979380668044485,"y":0.27034883734258564,"w":0.037113402684529617},{"x":0.14020617707389846,"y":0.26889534888713906,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.69484537760416665,"c":1,"t":"Oh, you won't have any problem. It's right in the centre of Stretton. It's the only old"},{"y":0.28479154452400224,"h":0.01614797416324143,"x":0.13814432664578652,"t":"building in the town, so it's easy to recognise.","w":0.3855670166015624,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395479069058,"t":"MELANIE: I know it. I presume it's open all day.","x":0.065979379128489155,"w":0.38144330342610683,"c":1,"y":0.30087209295329498},{"w":0.037113402684529631,"y":0.31976744197465035,"x":0.063917525351893267,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"t":"ROB:"},{"h":0.013211978860833917,"c":1,"t":"Yes, but if you'd like to see the prizes being awarded for the best flowers, you'll","y":0.31679389320587881,"w":0.66804122924804688,"x":0.14020618939659518},{"w":0.69896906534830727,"h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.33284883725900438,"c":1,"t":"need to be there at 5 o'clock. The prizes are being given by a famous actor. Kevin","x":0.13814433320043937},{"y":0.34879624167611722,"h":0.014679976512037674,"x":0.13814431746863837,"w":0.62680414835611975,"c":1,"t":"Shapless. He lives nearby and gets involved in a lot of community events."},{"x":0.061855670009489737,"t":"MELANIE: Gosh, I've seen him on TV. IlI definitely go to the prize-giving.","y":0.36482558156130529,"w":0.59999999999999998,"c":1,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"c":1,"t":"ROB:","w":0.037113402684529617,"x":0.063917525358766117,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"y":0.38372093035158827},{"t":"MELANIE: I've seen a list of plays that are being performed this week, and I'd like to know","y":0.4215116278397234,"x":0.063917513092272879,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"w":0.74226806640624998},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.69278350830078128,"c":1,"x":0.13814432822042211,"t":"which are suitable for my children, and which ones my husband and I might go to.","y":0.43746330010854861},{"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"t":"ROB:","w":0.035051546096801764,"x":0.063917525795487193,"y":0.45494186057722508},{"c":1,"h":0.014534883616744709,"w":0.22886596679687499,"t":"How old are your children?","y":0.45348837213850923,"x":0.1381443360870358},{"t":"MELANIE: Five and seven. What about 'The Mystery of Muldoon'?","w":0.5445159403483073,"y":0.46650951630348647,"x":0.061771739740822229,"h":0.018888528390415216,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418083724102,"y":0.48837209325192432,"w":0.037113402684529617,"t":"ROB:","c":1,"x":0.061855669688663031},{"c":1,"y":0.48401184045983903,"w":0.30952293395996094,"t":"That's aimed at five to ten-year-olds.","x":0.13598149750169597,"h":0.01604914259224588},{"t":"MELANIE:","h":0.010412310265962788,"y":0.50278803086715607,"c":1,"x":0.063883117535982636,"w":0.070171909332275406},{"h":0.016670276330487455,"c":1,"w":0.58775019327799483,"x":0.13191119516762687,"y":0.49987703560040719,"t":"So if I take my children, I can expect them to enjoy it more than I do?"},{"t":"ROB:","x":0.063917525898384037,"c":1,"h":0.010174418083723991,"y":0.5188953489280993,"w":0.032989689509073897},{"w":0.67845733642578132,"h":0.017169158317310584,"y":0.51557965131459682,"x":0.13397224153329337,"c":1,"t":"I think so. If you'd like something for yourself and your husband, and leave your"},{"c":1,"y":0.53343023249085053,"t":"children with a babysilter you might like to seeFire and Flood' - it's about events","h":0.013081395479069058,"w":0.69484537760416665,"x":0.13608246572577912},{"y":0.54785672337378521,"w":0.68865976969401033,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"t":"that really happened in Stretton two hundred years ago, and children might find it","x":0.13814434189125366},{"w":0.1557335027058919,"c":1,"h":0.019309336762531881,"t":"rather frightening.","x":0.13555888699372906,"y":0.5625045321874611},{"w":0.61669453938802088,"h":0.019274997767181223,"x":0.061764616103826879,"y":0.57807939707743128,"t":"MELANIE: Oh, thanks for the warning. And finally, what about 'Silly Sailor'?","c":1},{"h":0.01853825831791267,"w":0.69505203247070313,"x":0.13803574683979813,"y":0.59454647364829305,"c":1,"t":"That's a comedy, and it's for young and old. In fact, it won an award in the Stretton"},{"x":0.13803934954769478,"t":"Drama Festival a couple of months ago.","w":0.33840581258138025,"y":0.61142032593244888,"h":0.014733804511239845,"c":1},{"t":"MELANIE: OK. Well, goodbye, and thanks for all the information. I'm looking forward to the","w":0.75051544189453123,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1,"x":0.059793825280683943,"y":0.62790697690904618},{"h":0.018050626664041336,"c":1,"x":0.13595790317295064,"t":"Goodbye®","y":0.65812584924642736,"w":0.08478522618611653},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"Q4","y":0.09156976732223876,"c":1,"w":0.028865979512532558,"x":0.86391752560455848},{"w":0.028865979512532558,"x":0.86391752561248869,"c":1,"h":0.011627907341393184,"t":"Q6","y":0.20494186023806904},{"t":"Q8","y":0.48401162779154783,"x":0.86597938173347377,"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.026804122924804719,"c":1},{"y":0.51598837186438995,"w":0.026804122924804719,"c":1,"x":0.86597938191388646,"t":"Q9","h":0.013081395479068947},{"y":0.59528043750266368,"w":0.04139736175537112,"c":1,"x":0.86281253986400996,"h":0.01594562384918452,"t":"Q10"},{"y":0.71220930236811164,"w":0.16082473754882812,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"x":0.061855672359606567,"t":"SECTION 2"},{"w":0.7896907043457031,"h":0.015988371754420583,"x":0.061855678642058175,"y":0.74127906993443282,"c":1,"t":"Good morning, and welcome to the museum - one with a remarkable range of exhibits, which"},{"c":1,"x":0.063917531150078546,"y":0.75719318859054174,"t":"I'm sure you'll enjoy. My name's Greg, and I'Il tell you about the various collections as we go","w":0.77525772094726553,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"round. But before we go, let me just give you a taste of what we have here.","c":1,"x":0.059793818770558005,"y":0.77325581411808719,"w":0.63711339314778648,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"t":"Well, for one thing, we have a fine collection of twentieth and twenty-first century paintings,","h":0.015988371754420694,"y":0.79796511644610002,"c":1,"w":0.76701029459635417,"x":0.061855677335726396},{"c":1,"x":0.061855667661195449,"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.81385789778570616,"t":"many by very well-known artists. I'm sure you'll recognise several of the paintings. This is the. Q11","w":0.83917526245117191},{"h":0.015988371754420583,"x":0.059793824822253136,"t":"gallery that attracts the largest number of visitors, so it's best to go in early in the day, before","c":1,"y":0.82994186063203834,"w":0.78144327799479163},{"t":"the crowds arrive.","x":0.061855667829556843,"y":0.84732824411010488,"w":0.15257732391357423,"h":0.01174398120963005,"c":1},{"t":"Then there are the nineteenth-century paintings. The museum was opened in the middle of","y":0.86791522640446428,"w":0.76922882080078137,"x":0.063844893302804351,"h":0.017229866435509611,"c":1},{"w":0.77319585164388027,"c":1,"y":0.88662790714388484,"h":0.015988371754420694,"x":0.05979382665145077,"t":"that century, and several of the artists each donated one work - to get the museum started,"},{"c":1,"t":"Q12","y":0.88662790687315352,"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.039175256093343158,"x":0.863917526489411},{"y":0.90100232472544683,"t":"as it were. So they're of special interest to us - we feel closer to them than to other works.","w":0.76299336751302083,"h":0.016171130585236448,"x":0.05975020391936018,"c":1},{"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.29146792093912754,"c":1,"x":0.3521918184962084,"h":0.022615832576874939,"y":0.9543054561580997},{"t":"119","c":1,"x":0.91134020597843002,"y":0.94912790698846228,"h":0.014534883616744709,"w":0.043298969268798837}]}